cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its validation results, please cite it as below."
title: "KubeEstateHub: a cloud-native platform for statistically validated real-estate market analytics"
abstract: >-
  KubeEstateHub is a Kubernetes-native real-estate analytics platform. It pairs a
  production-grade service stack (listings API, dashboard, operator, SLO-based
  observability, policy-as-code and signed supply chain) with a reproducible analytics
  pipeline. The pipeline estimates a hedonic price index with robust errors, classifies
  market trends with nonparametric tests, values properties with split-conformal
  prediction intervals, and records full provenance for every result. All estimators are
  validated by Monte Carlo simulation against known ground truth.
type: software
